---
// src/components/About.astro
---

<section id="about" class="py-24 border-t border-slate-800/50">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6 max-w-6xl">

        <div class="mb-16 text-center md:text-left">
            <h2 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-400 to-indigo-500 mb-4 flex items-center gap-3 justify-center md:justify-start">
                <span class="text-blue-500">#</span> About & Experience
            </h2>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 text-slate-400 leading-relaxed text-lg mb-24">
            <div class="space-y-6">
                <p>
                    I am currently in my fourth year of the Computer Engineering
                    Degree at the University of Lleida, focusing on the
                    Artificial Intelligence and Computation branch.
                </p>
                <p>
                    My approach to software development combines solid
                    theoretical foundations with practical engineering. I am
                    deeply interested in system architecture, self-improving
                    algorithms, and building robust backend platforms.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-200 mb-6">
                    Core Technologies
                </h3>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">

                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg text-sm text-slate-300 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors cursor-default">
                        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/python/python-original.svg" alt="Python" class="w-5 h-5 shrink-0" />
                        <span class="font-medium">Python</span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg text-sm text-slate-300 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors cursor-default">
                        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/c/c-original.svg" alt="C" class="w-5 h-5 shrink-0" />
                        <span class="font-medium">C</span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg text-sm text-slate-300 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors cursor-default">
                        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/java/java-original.svg" alt="Java" class="w-5 h-5 shrink-0" />
                        <span class="font-medium">Java</span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg text-sm text-slate-300 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors cursor-default">
                        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/javascript/javascript-original.svg" alt="JavaScript" class="w-5 h-5 shrink-0" />
                        <span class="font-medium">JavaScript</span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg text-sm text-slate-300 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors cursor-default">
                        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/django/django-plain.svg" alt="Django" class="w-5 h-5 shrink-0" />
                        <span class="font-medium">Django</span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg text-sm text-slate-300 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors cursor-default">
                        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/linux/linux-original.svg" alt="Linux" class="w-5 h-5 shrink-0" />
                        <span class="font-medium">Linux</span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg text-sm text-slate-300 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors cursor-default">
                        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/docker/docker-original.svg" alt="Docker" class="w-5 h-5 shrink-0" />
                        <span class="font-medium">Docker</span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg text-sm text-slate-300 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors cursor-default">
                        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/amazonwebservices/amazonwebservices-original-wordmark.svg" alt="AWS" class="w-auto h-5 object-contain shrink-0" />
                        <span class="font-medium">AWS</span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg text-sm text-slate-300 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors cursor-default">
                        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/astro/astro-original.svg" alt="Astro" class="w-5 h-5 shrink-0" />
                        <span class="font-medium">Astro</span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg text-sm text-slate-300 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors cursor-default">
                        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/tailwindcss/tailwindcss-original.svg" alt="Tailwind CSS" class="w-5 h-5 shrink-0" />
                        <span class="font-medium">Tailwind CSS</span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg text-sm text-slate-300 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors cursor-default">
                        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/git/git-original.svg" alt="Git" class="w-5 h-5 shrink-0" />
                        <span class="font-medium">Git / CI/CD</span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded-lg text-sm text-slate-300 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors cursor-default">
                        <img src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/devicons/devicon@latest/icons/html5/html5-original.svg" alt="HTML" class="w-5 h-5 shrink-0" />
                        <span class="font-medium">HTML</span>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-200 mb-8 border-b border-slate-800 pb-4">Professional Experience</h3>

            <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center gap-8 bg-slate-900/40 p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 hover:border-slate-700 transition-colors">

                <div class="w-full md:w-1/4 flex-shrink-0 flex justify-center md:justify-start">
                    <a href="https://www.grupvoltes.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="group block overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-white p-4 shadow-lg hover:shadow-blue-500/10 transition-all duration-300 transform hover:scale-105" title="Visit Grup Voltes">
                        <img
                            src="/voltes.png"
                            alt="Grup Voltes Logo"
                            class="w-full h-auto object-contain max-h-20"
                        />
                    </a>
                </div>

                <div class="w-full md:w-3/4 space-y-3">
                    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2">
                        <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">IT Technician</h4>
                        <span class="text-sm font-medium text-blue-400 bg-blue-500/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-blue-500/20 w-fit">17th June 2026 - 31th August 2026</span>
                    </div>

                    <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 font-medium">Grup Voltes</p>

                    <div class="text-slate-400 text-base space-y-3 mt-4">
                        <p>
                            During my summer internship at Grup Voltes, I was part of the IT department where I did a lot of tasks, such as:
                        </p>
                        <ul class="list-disc list-outside pl-5 space-y-2 ml-1 marker:text-blue-500">
                            <li class="pl-1">Handling all kinds of internal issues related to electronic devices or software. These could be resolved in person or remotely (helpdesk).</li>
                            <li class="pl-1">With the help of other interns, conducted a series of interviews with employees to identify bottlenecks and repetitive tasks, and we compiled a list of tasks that could be automated, proposing and developing application prototypes in some cases.</li>
                            <li class="pl-1">Configuration and preparation of devices with corporational software and needs (Laptops, printers, phones, tablets...)</li>
                            <li class="pl-1">Elaboration of multiple instruction manuals for common IT procedures and configurations</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>